      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KINGSBRAE EMMA (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 350m behind Heroic Federer (20.55) in a NG. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Worth another chance. CALLA NAUGHTY (3) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 20.13 beating LOVE THIS BAR. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from five starts. Expected to feature again. KICK IT OFF (2) was out of the placings last time but before that was an impressive winner (20.40) in a Grade 5 at this track. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. NAVAL CHOICE (7) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
